{
  "text": "线性时不变系统\n- 单入单出\n$$\\xrightarrow{x(t)}\\boxed{~~L(\\cdot)~~}\\xrightarrow{y(t)}$$\n- 线性：系统输入线性和的响应等于响应的线性和（叠加原理）\n$$y\\left( t\\right)  = L\\left\\lbrack  {\\mathop{\\sum }\\limits_{i}{C}_{i}{x}_{i}\\left( t\\right) }\\right\\rbrack   = \\mathop{\\sum }\\limits_{i}{C}_{i}L\\left\\lbrack  {{x}_{i}\\left( t\\right) }\\right\\rbrack$$\n- 时不变性（恒参）\n若$L[\\delta(t)] = h(t)$时，$L[\\delta(t-\\tau)] = h(t-\\tau)$\n- 对于线性时不变系统，\n$$h(t) \\Leftrightarrow H(f) = \\frac{Y(f)}{X(f)} = |H(f)| e^{j\\varphi(f)}$$\n——传递函数\n42",
